# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): FX's two pages (the Types page folded in, Evan 2026-10-28). Delay
# at rest, KNOB 4 in two halves (Dly mix, "+ SEL Type"); SEL + KNOB 4 turning the delay's type, its lower half lit
# and only Mix dim; Reverb with its type on KNOB 3 and "+ SEL Into" under Rev mix, then SEL + KNOB 4 turning what
# goes into it. Not a test of its own (no expectations).
notips
tap PLAY
wait 2000
tap FX
wait 2000
shot delay-rest.png
press SEL
spin K4 1
wait 300
shot delay-sel.png
spin K4 -1
release SEL
wait 2000
spin K4 5
wait 300
shot delay-mix.png
tap FX
wait 2000
shot reverb-rest.png
press SEL
spin K4 1
wait 300
shot reverb-sel.png
spin K4 -1
release SEL
